flowchart TD
  Page[Level or record page] --> Select[Select record and ghost URL]
  Select --> Fetch[Fetch compressed ghost and level assets]
  Fetch --> Cache[Reuse bounded browser cache when available]
  Cache --> Decode[Decode supported ghost version, up to 3 concurrent loads]
  Decode --> Schedule[Schedule frames against playback clock]
  Schedule --> Scene[Render car, level, and analysis overlays]
  Decode -->|unsupported or corrupt| Error[Show playback error]
  Fetch -->|unavailable| Error
